WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.094
Prepare one small test of the guide.

00:00:03.094 --> 00:00:11.933
Ask whether a first-time participant can locate it, understand the scope, complete one practice estimate and identify the help route.

00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:15.027
Name the relevant participant and appropriate permission.

00:00:15.027 --> 00:00:20.331
Show the offer sentence, corrected access instruction, guide sample and support note.

00:00:20.331 --> 00:00:26.519
Ask what the person expected, where they hesitated and how they checked the result.

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:30.938
Define the evidence standard and decision rule before collecting feedback.

00:00:30.938 --> 00:00:38.010
A missed starting step or an expectation of unlimited review supports revising the instructions or scope.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.778
Missing permission supports pausing.

00:00:39.778 --> 00:00:41.988
Label invented responses as simulated.

00:00:41.988 --> 00:00:46.407
Completion of this bounded task may inform clarity and usability.

00:00:46.407 --> 00:00:49.501
It does not establish willingness to pay.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:54.805
Save the plan for the delivery test in Lesson Four Point Six.
